    "body": "fix on issue/3450-dxf-classes-section · PR #3672 · pinned by an_ac1015_export_gives_the_same_closed_chains_as_its_r12_twin, a_truncated_ac1015_export_never_imports, an_entity_in_a_section_without_geometry_is_refused, inert_objects_must_be_owned_members_of_the_object_tree · merges when reviewed\n\nA second review added one refusal. A record with an entity name in OBJECTS, CLASSES, THUMBNAILIMAGE or ACDSDATA is now refused. Before, such a record could be dropped with no diagnostic. The three QA files import on the PR head (q04: 2 closed chains, same as its R12 twin; q06: 1 closed chain). The PR is a draft. A collaborator must replace the label `claimed` with `in-review`, because the contributor account cannot set labels.",
